  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2602.12 \"Fireworks\" means \"fireworks\" as defined in RSA 160-B:1, I, but does not include permissible fireworks.\n\nSource. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15 (from Saf-C 2602.10)",
